{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:80fc402133201fbe","name":"Discovery","source":{"id":"source:reference-80fc402133201fbe","title":"Discovery","revision":18106,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:35:56Z","sha256":"1a6ee8ecbf2f59475a2d105ca4d40e32b0653b6db37a1301e55ddd50ebc7dbb1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18106","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Discovery&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-80fc402133201fbe","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," is to discover a person, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},", object, or location that was either previously lost or unknown to the civilized galaxy. This could be as simple as seeking out the remains of a long-dead hero, or as rare as finding a vergence in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". A Scout's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," might be to find a thus-far-uncharted world that helps solve a galactic crisis, while a Scoundrel's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," might be to chart a new route through ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Deep Core"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Deep_Core?action=edit&redlink=1"},", allowing ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}," to sneak past the Empire's security web. The thing being discovered should be something that can only be found as the result of a long-term search or serendipitous events that only occur because the character long ago set down the path that would lead to that Discovery.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Examples of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," include Qui-Gon Jinn's discovery of Anakin Skywalker on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tatooine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tatooine","referenceId":"reference:a1b911e88e4876e1"}," or Kyle Katarn's discovery of the Valley of the Jedi. If you are a Jedi, you might seek out other Jedi in hiding after the massacre at ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ossus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ossus","referenceId":"reference:8196389ed661366f"},". Scouts working for ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," might try to uncover Emperor Fel's military plans, especially after he takes control of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bastion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bastion","referenceId":"reference:863cf03d3363b90e"},". Galactic Alliance agents might seek out resources or reinforcements.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Destiny Bonus:"]}," For 24 hours, you and any ally within 10 squares of you gain a +1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," bonus to all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will"},")."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Destiny Penalty:"]}," You take a -1 penalty to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will"},") for 24 hours."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Destiny Fulfilled:"]}," You gain a permanent +1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will"},")."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Sample Destinies"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Base of Resistance"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," requires you to establish a hidden base that provides a safe haven and support for resistance fighters in a specific region. You might need to locate a new world that could accommodate a secret base or find a concealed facility on a known world from which dissenters covertly operate against the Empire. You might need to gather allies and create secret support networks to maintain the base, supply it with equipment and weapons, and provide transportation for resistance forces. The scope of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," varies; it might be enough to establish a secret gathering place and a supply depot to aid resistance fighters in a single city, or it might require the construction of a fully operational base to support paramilitary operations in an entire system or even a sector.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Force Unleashed"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You believe ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to be far more powerful than most people think it is. Your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," requires you to discover the depths of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," and its abilities, expose friendly Force-users to this potential, and prevent enemies from wielding such power against you and your allies. The Gamemaster can use this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," in combination with a special campaign to allow characters access to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unleashed Abilities"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unleashed_Abilities","referenceId":"reference:f5c75963e378fe0b"}," and gain use of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unleashed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unleashed","referenceId":"reference:705d98f886258468"}," feat. Characters who are not Force-sensitive could take this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," to gain access to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unleashed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unleashed","referenceId":"reference:705d98f886258468"}," feat. Campaigns might focus on one aspect of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"},", such as discovering and learning new powers, preventing a specific enemy from using ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unleashed Abilities"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unleashed_Abilities","referenceId":"reference:f5c75963e378fe0b"},", or training another Force-user. For long-term campaigns, one aspect of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," might lead to the next. An example of a character with this Destiny is Darth Vader's secret apprentice.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
